<body data-page="04A"><nav data-site-nav aria-label="dSpark 学习页面"></nav><main class="page page--wide">
  <header class="hero"><span class="topic-badge">专题页 · 归属 04 置信度 / 预算 / 布局</span><p class="eyebrow">04A · 历史置信度与 SPS 预算</p><h1>默认 overlap 与 non-overlap 都用两轮前的 confidence，只是延迟由不同组件持有</h1><p class="lead">稳定连续 decode 下，二者都把 <code>C_(t-2)</code> 送进 Host planner。overlap 的两轮延迟在 <code>FutureMap / ConfidenceRelay</code>；non-overlap 没有 relay，于是 <code>HostConfidenceBudgetPlanner</code> 自己 carry 两轮。</p><div class="evidence-strip"><span><strong>默认</strong> · <code>SGLANG_DSPARK_CONFIDENCE_RELAY_LAG_STEPS=2</code></span><span><strong>overlap</strong> · relay_lag=2，carry=0</span><span><strong>non-overlap</strong> · relay_lag=0，carry=2</span><span><strong>结果</strong> · steady-state budget 都看 <code>C_(t-2)</code></span></div><div class="route-switch"><button type="button" data-route-choice="static-greedy">STATIC · 贪心</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="compact-sampling">COMPACT · 随机采样</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="folded-greedy">FOLDED · 贪心</button></div><div data-semantic-legend></div></header>
  <section class="handoff"><div class="handoff__item"><b>输入 · 历史样本</b><span><code>ResolvedConfidence(confidence, generation)</code>，按当前请求的 pool row 对齐。</span></div><div class="handoff__item"><b>保护条件</b><span><code>lagged_generation == current_generation</code>；否则 survival 使用全 1。</span></div><div class="handoff__item"><b>输出</b><span><code>VerifyBudgetDecision(budget, predicted_step_seconds, predicted_theta)</code>。</span></div><div class="handoff__item"><b>下一消费者</b><span><code>resolve_verify_token_budget()</code> 只取 Python <code>int budget</code>，04B 再按当前 confidence 分配。</span></div></section>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="lag-title"><div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">主视图 · 连续 t0 / t1 / t2 时间线</p><h2 id="lag-title">相同历史年龄，不同持有者与 warm-up</h2><p class="section__intro">“两轮前”是 generation 匹配、同一请求连续 decode 的稳态描述。batch 交错、非 decode、pool row 复用或 relay 尚未 ready 时要看 fallback。</p></div>
    <div class="visual stepper" data-stepper data-steps="5"><div class="visual__bar"><span><strong>两条对齐泳道</strong> · t0 产生 C0，t2 才用于 budget2</span><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#lag-canvas">放大主图</button></div><div class="visual__body"><div class="stepper__toolbar"><div class="stepper__buttons"><button type="button" data-step-action="prev">上一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="next">下一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="play">播放</button><button type="button" data-step-action="reset">重置</button></div><div class="stepper__progress"><span data-step-progress></span></div><div class="stepper__status" data-step-status></div></div><div class="canvas-scroll"><div id="lag-canvas" class="lag-canvas">
      <div class="lag-head"><div>执行模式 / 持有者</div><div>t0 · proposal 返回</div><div>t0 · publish / carry</div><div>t1 · 中间轮</div><div>t2 · 解析</div><div>t2 · Worker 使用</div></div>
      <div class="lag-row"><div class="lane">overlap<br><code>FutureMap</code></div><div class="lag-event" data-step-node="0"><b>产生 C0</b><code>Worker t0 → confidence</code></div><div class="lag-event" data-kind="guard" data-step-node="1"><b>publish 到 relay ring</b><code>on_publish(C0,generation)</code><br>private D2H stream</div><div class="lag-event" data-kind="off" data-step-node="2"><b>ring 保持两轮</b><code>CONFIDENCE_RELAY_RING_LAG=2</code></div><div class="lag-event" data-kind="main" data-step-node="3"><b>Scheduler 提前 resolve</b><code>prepare_verify_budget()</code><br>写 draft_input.verify_token_budget</div><div class="lag-event" data-kind="main" data-step-node="4"><b>Worker 直接读取</b><code>return draft_input.verify_token_budget</code></div></div>
      <div class="lag-row"><div class="lane">non-overlap<br><code>Host planner</code></div><div class="lag-event" data-step-node="0"><b>产生 C0</b><code>Worker t0 → confidence</code></div><div class="lag-event" data-kind="guard" data-step-node="1"><b>同步送入 planner</b><code>compute_budget_sync()</code><br>先取 carry 旧槽，再写 C0</div><div class="lag-event" data-kind="off" data-step-node="2"><b>本地 carry 两轮</b><code>carry_steps=2</code></div><div class="lag-event" data-kind="main" data-step-node="3"><b>t2 取出 C0</b><code>_shift_to_lag()</code><br>C0 → history survival</div><div class="lag-event" data-kind="main" data-step-node="4"><b>同步返回 budget</b><code>compute_budget_sync() → int</code></div></div>
      <div class="dependency-note" style="margin-top:16px"><strong>公式对齐：</strong>overlap：<code>lag_steps=2, relay_lag=2, carry=0</code>；non-overlap：<code>lag_steps=2, relay_lag=0, carry=2</code>。因此默认稳态观察到的都是 <code>C_(t-2)</code>。</div>
    </div></div></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="sps-title"><div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">辅助视图 · 手算 SPS 目标函数</p><h2 id="sps-title">历史 survival 的收益一直增加，但 SPS 档位下降可让最优 budget 提前停止</h2><p class="section__intro">此处用独立的历史样本，避免与 04B 的当前分配样本混淆。普通 <code>SpsCostTable</code> 使用 <code>theta=tau_star×steps_per_sec</code>；additive 表改用 <code>tau_star/step_time</code>。</p></div>
    <div class="visual"><div class="visual__bar"><span><strong>固定教学表</strong> · probes=[1,5]，SPS=[1.0,.5]</span><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#sps-canvas">放大辅助图</button></div><div class="visual__body" id="sps-canvas"><div class="canvas-scroll"><div class="formula-flow"><article class="formula-card"><b>1 · C_(t-2)</b><code>R0 [.90,.80,.50,.20]<br>R1 [.70,.60,.50,.40]</code><p>generation 匹配才有效。</p></article><article class="formula-card"><b>2 · cumprod</b><code>R0 [.900,.720,.360,.072]<br>R1 [.700,.420,.210,.084]</code><p>这是历史 survival。</p></article><article class="formula-card"><b>3 · 全局降序</b><code>.900,.720,.700,.420,<br>.360,.210,.084,.072</code><p>删除低于 survival_eps 的值。</p></article><article class="formula-card" data-kind="guard"><b>4 · tau_star(k)</b><code>B + prefixSum(top-k)<br>B=2</code><p>基础 B 表示每请求 anchor 仍可产生一个 bonus。</p></article><article class="formula-card" data-kind="main"><b>5 · 选最大 theta</b><code>argmax tau_star×SPS<br>→ k=2</code><p><code>VerifyBudgetDecision.budget=2</code></p></article></div>
      <table class="budget-table" aria-label="各 budget 候选的收益与 SPS 目标"><thead><tr><th>k / extra budget</th><th>B+k tokens</th><th>tau_star(k)</th><th>SPS</th><th>theta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>2</td><td>2.000</td><td>1.0</td><td>2.000</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>3</td><td>2.900</td><td>1.0</td><td>2.900</td></tr><tr data-best="true"><td>2 · 最优</td><td>4</td><td>3.620</td><td>1.0</td><td><strong>3.620</strong></td></tr><tr data-cliff="true"><td>3 · SPS 降档</td><td>5</td><td>4.320</td><td>0.5</td><td>2.160</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>6</td><td>4.740</td><td>0.5</td><td>2.370</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>7</td><td>5.100</td><td>0.5</td><td>2.550</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>8</td><td>5.310</td><td>0.5</td><td>2.655</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>9</td><td>5.394</td><td>0.5</td><td>2.697</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>10</td><td>5.466</td><td>0.5</td><td>2.733</td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">为什么 / 边界</p><h2>启动、缺 profile 与 0/None 必须分开理解</h2></div><div class="warmup-grid"><article class="warmup-card" data-kind="guard"><b>overlap warm-up</b><p>relay 尚未积累两轮或 copy event 未 ready 时，resolve 可能为 None；这轮 budget 也是 None。</p></article><article class="warmup-card" data-kind="off"><b>non-overlap warm-up</b><p>carry 初始 generation 不匹配，历史 survival 回退全 1，再结合 SPS table 计算，不等同于直接返回 None。</p></article><article class="warmup-card"><b>无 profiled SPS</b><p>flat SPS + 非负 survival 使最优通常退化到 verify-all；COMPACT 识别为 <code>_is_verify_all</code> 并复用 uniform layout。</p></article><article class="warmup-card" data-kind="fail"><b>budget 0 vs None</b><p>0 是“明确不选 extra”；None 是“本轮无 budget 控制”。mandatory anchor floor 不在 budget optimizer 中扣除。</p></article></div></section>
  <details class="source-details"><summary>源码锚点与可核验边界</summary><div class="source-details__body"><div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/managers/overlap_utils.py:118–229, 352–359</code><span><code>ConfidenceRelay</code> 的 ring lag=2、异步 D2H 与 <code>FutureMap.resolve_confidence_cpu()</code>。</span></div><div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_planner.py:295–417</code><span>overlap 的提前 budget 写入、non-overlap 的同步 resolve 与 generation 对齐。</span></div><div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_planner.py:948–1020</code><span><code>compute_verify_token_budget()</code> 的 tau_star、SPS/step-time objective 与 decision。</span></div><div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_planner.py:1023–1130</code><span>lag/carry、generation guard、warm-up fallback。</span></div><div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/environ.py:789</code><span>默认 <code>SGLANG_DSPARK_CONFIDENCE_RELAY_LAG_STEPS=2</code>。</span></div></div></details>
